      "source": "Configuration interface to be implemented by most if not all <a href=\"../ConversionService.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a>\ntypes. Consolidates the read-only operations exposed by <a href=\"../ConversionService.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> and\nthe mutating operations of <a href=\"../converter/ConverterRegistry.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>ConverterRegistry</code></a> to allow for convenient ad-hoc\naddition and removal of <a href=\"../converter/Converter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converters</code></a> through. The latter is particularly useful when working against a\n<a href=\"../../env/ConfigurableEnvironment.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>ConfigurableEnvironment</code></a>\ninstance in application context bootstrapping code.",
      "translation": "大多数（如果不是全部）<a href=\"../ConversionService.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> 类型需要实现的配置接口。该接口整合了 <a href=\"../ConversionService.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> 公开的只读操作和 <a href=\"../converter/ConverterRegistry.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>ConverterRegistry</code></a> 的变更操作，以便方便地通过它添加和移除 <a href=\"../converter/Converter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converters</code></a>。后者在应用程序上下文引导代码中针对 <a href=\"../../env/ConfigurableEnvironment.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>ConfigurableEnvironment</code></a> 实例工作时特别有用。",
